From 5f53c67d1b5e193c4678cab8211b8c0fef1d2241 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dwc2d <dwc2d@localhost>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 02:35:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] dwc2d: ask only the hub ports that changed, the link
 every 5 s (#126)

The hotplug rescan asked every port of every hub for its status and the
LAN7800 twice for its link, each second: about 20 control transfers, each
waited for on the CPU. Each hub's status change endpoint says which ports
changed (it NAKs when none did), so only those are asked; every tenth
rescan still asks all ports. The link is asked every 5 s, and when an
adapter is new.
